  "description": "The Freemax Rexa Pro is the most advanced model in the Rexa series — a feature-packed pod vape kit that combines premium design with cutting-edge technology. At its core is a powerful 1300mAh battery supported by fast 2A USB-C charging, paired with smart vaping modes and a responsive 2.5-inch HD touchscreen. Designed for MTL (mouth-to-lung) and RDL (restricted direct-lung) styles, the Rexa Pro includes a 0.6ohm Duomax Pod featuring Freemax’s dual mesh coil with tea fibre cotton. The pod delivers long-lasting flavour across up to 100ml of Freebase or 60ml of Nic Salt e-liquid , and its slide-fill mechanism ensures simple, leak-resistant refilling. The Rexa Pro offers a smart multi-function suite with Bluetooth support for audio playback and animated UI effects that bring an interactive feel to your vape setup. The clean zinc-alloy frame and nano-coated internals add a premium touch to this highly functional pod kit. Please Note: When filling your pod with vape juice for the first time, allow the pod to sit for ten minutes before use. This will allow the e-liquid to better saturate the wicking material, a type of cotton, to prevent dry hits and ensure the best flavour and performance from your coil.",
